WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.640
On the way to Jerusalem, two
brothers, James and John,

2
00:00:03.690 --> 00:00:05.160
make a request.

3
00:00:05.210 --> 00:00:07.940
They want the best seats in Jesus' glory:

4
00:00:07.990 --> 00:00:10.760
one at his right hand, one at his left.

5
00:00:10.810 --> 00:00:13.310
The other ten are angry with them.

6
00:00:13.360 --> 00:00:16.620
Later, at night, in the
high priest's courtyard,

7
00:00:16.670 --> 00:00:19.330
Peter is challenged three times.

8
00:00:19.380 --> 00:00:23.640
The third time, he curses and
swears he doesn't know Jesus.

9
00:00:23.690 --> 00:00:28.460
So why would Mark tell us his
closest followers got it so wrong?

10
00:00:28.510 --> 00:00:32.320
In this mission, you'll follow
Jesus' 3 predictions of his death,

11
00:00:32.370 --> 00:00:34.990
and what the disciples made of each one.

12
00:00:35.040 --> 00:00:39.080
Then you'll weigh up what their
failures mean for Christians today.

13
00:00:39.130 --> 00:00:43.230
Your mission: find out why Mark
tells us about these failures.
